 \quad S_{ac}=F_cF_aP.
\]
Here D is the actual nonnegative electric multiplication operator of the common parent, including the vacancy gates and charge-dependent linear terms. It is not replaced by its empty-B expression. The bounded magnetic perturbation makes h self-adjoint on D(D), and finite-support physical charge/electric words form a core.

